  "description": "IP-based geolocation for Umbraco sites. Detects visitor country via CDN headers (Cloudflare CF-IPCountry, AWS CloudFront-Viewer-Country, Azure Front Door X-Azure-ClientIP) with an offline MMDB fallback (iplocate.io). Resolves country codes to .NET CultureInfo for seamless multi-language switching. Pluggable provider chain, Umbraco middleware integration, and configurable culture mapping.",
